    "result": "I added both methods to `RateLimiter` in `src/rate-limiter.js`. I haven't run the code or any tests.\n\n- **`reset(key)`** deletes the key's bucket, so the key starts fresh on its next request.\n- **`remaining(key, now = Date.now())`** returns the limit minus the requests already counted in the current window. If the key has no bucket, or its bucket is from an earlier window, it returns the full limit. It only reads the bucket, so it never counts as a request and never creates one.\n\nI didn't change `allow()`.",
